 "rationale": "The phone as camera and album: taking photos, looking at them, sending them, and idle time on the phone in between.",
 "mixUps": "Three verbs on shashin: toru (take), miru (look at), okuru (send). Idle phone use is ijiru, not asobu or tsukau, and shashin o okuru shares okuru with meeru o okuru.",
 "targets": [
  {
   "id": "c-shashin-o-toru",
