   "use": "Said whenever photos come up, mostly as requests: shashin totte (take a photo of me or us), and shashin totte moraemasu ka? to a stranger. Casual speech drops o.",
   "notes": "The one English 'take' that is toru. Take medicine is kusuri o nomu, a shower shawaa o abiru, a train densha ni noru, time jikan ga kakaru. toreru = come out in the photo: yoku toreta (it came out well).",
   "example": {
    "romaji": "issho ni shashin torou yo.",
    "ja": "一緒に写真撮ろうよ。",
    "english": "Let's take a picture together."
   },
   "examplePolite": {
    "romaji": "issho ni shashin o torimashou.",
    "ja": "一緒に写真を撮りましょう。",
    "english": "Let's take a picture together."
   }
  },
