   "verbSense": "fiddle with, tinker with",
   "englishVerb": "use",
   "trap": "Not tsukau or sumaho o asobu: idly being on your phone is sumaho (o) ijiru, and zutto sumaho miteru is just as common. tsukau is understood but sounds like using it for a task; sumaho de asobu is fine but means playing games on it.",
   "partners": [
